Third-party data (NOT distributed in this repository)

This project analyses two public Kaggle datasets, downloaded at run time by
SK_download.py. The original files and row-level derived tables are excluded
by .gitignore; only aggregate results under output/ are committed.

  D1  sylviawyon/bilibili-2025-top-100-creators-video-dataset
      License: MIT
      https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/sylviawyon/bilibili-2025-top-100-creators-video-dataset

  D2  calefctinpan/bilibili-zhang-xuefeng-video-records
      License: Apache License 2.0
      https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/calefctinpan/bilibili-zhang-xuefeng-video-records

Please consult each dataset's own page for the authoritative license text and
attribution requirements before redistributing any source files. No personal
data, comment text, cookies or authentication material is used or stored.

The SUCCES framework is described in Chip Heath & Dan Heath, "Made to Stick"
(2007) and is referenced here solely as an object of academic analysis.
